('synergy effect','poké-body','If Phoebe''s Stadium is in play, prevent all damage done to Sableye by attacks from your opponent''s Pokémon-ex.'),
('safeguard','poké-body','Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Wobbuffet by your opponent''s Pokémon-ex.'),
