('natural cure','poké-body','When you attach a Fire Energy card from your hand to Combusken, remove all Special Conditions from Combusken.'),
('synergy effect','poké-body','If Glacia''s Stadium is in play, any damage done to Glalie by attacks from your opponent''s Pokémon is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).'),
